      "id": "in_fpc",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1650,
      "src": "fpc := 30 MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_futa",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1696,
      "src": "futa := 400 MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_phi_b",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1742,
      "src": "phi_b := 0.9"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_phi_brg",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1788,
      "src": "phi_brg := 0.65"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_phi_sa",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1834,
      "src": "phi_sa := 0.75"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_usa_friccion",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1880,
      "src": "usa_friccion := 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_mu_fr",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1926,
      "src": "mu_fr := 0.4"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_phi_fr",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1972,
      "src": "phi_fr := 0.65"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2018,
      "src": "━━ 1 — APLASTAMIENTO DEL HORMIGÓN · AISC 360-22 §J8 y DG1 Ec. 4-2 y 4-3a ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t013",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2064,
      "src": "El confinamiento es √(A2/A1) con A2 el área semejante a la placa que cabe en el pedestal, y no pasa de 2."
    },
    {
      "id": "v_datos_opciones",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2110,
      "src": "v_datos_opciones := (torque == 0 or torque == 1) and (usa_friccion == 0 or usa_friccion == 1) and exposicion >= 1 and exposicion <= 3 and exposicion == round(exposicion) and n_col >= 1 and n_col == round(n_col) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_conf",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2156,
      "src": "conf := min(PED_L/L_bp, PED_B/B_bp, 2.0) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_conf_no_topa",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2202,
      "src": "v_conf_no_topa := conf < 2.0 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_fp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2248,
      "src": "f_p := phi_brg*0.85*fpc*conf = kPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_A1",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2294,
      "src": "A_1 := L_bp*B_bp = m^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_phiPp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2340,
      "src": "phiPp := f_p*A_1 = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_u_aplast",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2386,
      "src": "u_aplast := P_comp/phiPp ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2432,
      "src": "━━ 2 — DOMINIO DE LA HOJA · DG1 §4.3.7, Ec. 4-37, 4-39 y 4-40 ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2478,
      "src": "Con e ≤ e_crit la compresión se equilibra solo por aplastamiento y no hay tracción en los pernos: es el momento bajo. Con e > e_crit hace falta el grupo en tracción y la hoja deja de valer. El arranque se trata concéntrico (DG1 §4.3.2): con momento, también queda fuera. Las dos condiciones votan."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_qmax",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2524,
      "src": "q_max := f_p*B_bp = kN/m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_ecomp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2570,
      "src": "e_comp := abs(M_comp)/P_comp = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_ecrit",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2616,
      "src": "e_crit := L_bp/2 - P_comp/(2*q_max) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_dominio_comp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2662,
      "src": "v_dominio_comp := e_comp <= e_crit ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_dominio_trac",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2708,
      "src": "v_dominio_trac := P_trac >= 0 kN or abs(M_trac) < 1e-6 kN*m ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2754,
      "src": "━━ 3 — ESPESOR POR EL APLASTAMIENTO · DG1 §4.3.1 (Ec. 4-10 a 4-15a) y §4.3.7 (Ec. 4-42 a 4-50a) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2800,
      "src": "Compresión concéntrica: el voladizo crítico es el mayor de m, n y λn', este último por la flexión de la placa entre las alas (Thornton). X se acota en 1 porque con la placa sobrecargada la raíz no existe; ese caso ya lo marca u_aplast."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_m",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2846,
      "src": "m_vol := (L_bp - 0.95*d_col)/2 = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_n",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2892,
      "src": "n_vol := (B_bp - 0.8*bf_col)/2 = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_X",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2938,
      "src": "X_th := min(4*d_col*bf_col/(d_col + bf_col)^2*P_comp/phiPp, 1) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_lam",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2984,
      "src": "lam := min(2*sqrt(X_th)/(1 + sqrt(1 - X_th)), 1) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_lnp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3030,
      "src": "lnp := lam*sqrt(d_col*bf_col)/4 = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_l",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3076,
      "src": "l_crit := max(m_vol, n_vol, lnp) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_t_axial",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3122,
      "src": "t_axial := l_crit*sqrt(2*P_comp/(phi_b*Fy_ac*B_bp*L_bp)) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "t018",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3168,
      "src": "Con momento bajo, la presión es uniforme sobre Y = L_bp − 2e, y el voladizo de cálculo es el mayor de m y n. Dentro del dominio Y no baja de P/q_max; la cota solo evita que la hoja se rompa fuera de él, donde ya vota en contra."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Y",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3214,
      "src": "Y_b := max(L_bp - 2*e_comp, P_comp/q_max) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_fpb",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3260,
      "src": "f_pb := P_comp/(B_bp*Y_b) = kPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_lmn",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3306,
      "src": "l_mn := max(m_vol, n_vol) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Mpl",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3352,
      "src": "Mpl_mom := Y_b >= l_mn ? f_pb*l_mn^2/2 : f_pb*Y_b*(l_mn - Y_b/2) = kN*m/m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_t_mom",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3398,
      "src": "t_mom := sqrt(4*Mpl_mom/(phi_b*Fy_ac)) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_t_aplast",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3444,
      "src": "t_aplast := max(t_axial, t_mom) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "t019",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3490,
      "src": "━━ 4 — PERNOS EN TRACCIÓN · DG1 §4.3.2 y Ec. 4-23 (ACI 318-25 §17.6.1.2) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t020",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3536,
      "src": "El arranque concéntrico se reparte por igual entre todos los pernos. El anclaje en el hormigón es de anclaje-hormigon-generica, con T_grupo y los 2·n_col pernos que traccionan."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Tu",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3582,
      "src": "T_grupo := max(-P_trac, 0 kN) = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_npernos",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3628,
      "src": "n_trac := 2*n_col ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_ru",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3674,
      "src": "r_u := T_grupo/n_trac = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_phiRn",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3720,
      "src": "phiRn := phi_sa*futa*Ase_perno = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_u_pernos",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3766,
      "src": "u_pernos := r_u/phiRn ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t021",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3812,
      "src": "━━ 5 — FLEXIÓN DE LA PLACA POR EL ARRANQUE · DG1 §4.3.2 paso 4 y Ejemplo 4.7-3 ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t022",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3858,
      "src": "El perno tira de la placa, que trabaja en voladizo desde la cara del elemento que la sostiene: el alma, si las filas quedan entre las alas, o el ala, si quedan fuera del perfil. El ancho eficaz sale de repartir a 45° desde el eje del perno hasta esa cara, b = 2a por perno. Una fila bajo el ala no es ninguna de las dos y no vale."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_dh",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3904,
      "src": "d_hueco := d_perno + holgura = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_dentro",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3950,
      "src": "dentro := y_t + d_hueco/2 <= d_col/2 - tf_col ? 1 : 0 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_fuera",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3996,
      "src": "fuera := y_t - d_hueco/2 >= d_col/2 ? 1 : 0 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_posicion",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4042,
      "src": "v_posicion := dentro + fuera == 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t023",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4088,
      "src": "Dentro del perfil caben dos pernos por fila, uno a cada lado del alma, con el agujero libre de ella."
    },
    {
      "id": "v_dentro_dos",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4134,
      "src": "v_dentro_dos := dentro == 0 or n_col == 2 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_libre_alma",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4180,
      "src": "v_libre_alma := dentro == 0 or x_ext - d_hueco/2 >= tw_col/2 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_a",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4226,
      "src": "a_pal := dentro == 1 ? x_ext - tw_col/2 : y_t - d_col/2 = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "t024",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4272,
      "src": "Dentro, cada lado del alma recibe dos pernos, a ±y_t: sus anchos a 45° se suman o se solapan, sin pasar de la altura libre del alma. Fuera, cada fila recibe n_col pernos, sin pasar del ancho del ala."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Tlado",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4318,
      "src": "T_lado := dentro == 1 ? 2*r_u : n_col*r_u = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_beff",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4364,
      "src": "b_eff := dentro == 1 ? min(2*y_t + 2*a_pal, 4*a_pal, d_col - 2*tf_col) : min(2*x_ext + 2*a_pal, 2*n_col*a_pal, bf_col) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Marr",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4410,
      "src": "M_arr := T_lado*a_pal = kN*m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_t_arr",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4456,
      "src": "t_arr := T_grupo > 0 kN and a_pal > 0 mm ? sqrt(4*M_arr/(b_eff*phi_b*Fy_ac)) : 0 mm = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "t025",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4502,
      "src": "━━ 6 — ESPESOR DE LA CHAPA ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_t_req",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4548,
      "src": "t_req := max(t_aplast, t_arr) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_u_esp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4594,
      "src": "u_espesor := t_req/t_bp ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t026",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4640,
      "src": "━━ 7 — GEOMETRÍA MÍNIMA DEL GRUPO ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t027",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4686,
      "src": "Las mismas tres distancias de placa-base-generica: paso entre pernos (ACI 318-25 Tabla 17.9.2(a), 4·d_a sin torque y 6·d_a con torque), borde de chapa (AISC 360-22 Tabla J3.4M más C2 de la Tabla J3.5M, o la holgura de la arandela de la DG1) y borde de hormigón (recubrimiento de la Tabla 20.5.1.3.1 más medio diámetro). El paso se mide en la fila y entre filas."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_paso",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4732,
      "src": "paso_real := n_col > 1 ? min(2*x_ext/(n_col - 1), 2*y_t) : 2*y_t = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_paso_min",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4778,
      "src": "paso_min := (torque == 1 ? 6 : 4)*d_perno = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_paso",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4824,
      "src": "v_paso := paso_real >= paso_min*(1 - 1e-9) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_bordeJ34",
      "kind": "program",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4870,
      "src": "borde_J34 :=\n    dm := d_perno/(1 mm)\n    if dm > 36\n        return 1.25*d_perno\n    tabla := [12, 18; 16, 22; 20, 26; 22, 28; 24, 30; 27, 34; 30, 38; 36, 46]\n    for k in 1:8\n        if dm <= tabla[k, 1]\n            return tabla[k, 2]*(1 mm)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_C2",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5074,
      "src": "C2 := (d_perno <= 22 mm ? 2 : 3)*(1 mm) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_bordeDG1",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5120,
      "src": "borde_DG1 := d_hueco/2 + 2 inch = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_borde_placa",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5166,
      "src": "borde_placa_min := max(borde_J34 + C2, borde_DG1) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_ancho_req",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5212,
      "src": "ancho_req := 2*(x_ext + borde_placa_min) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_ancho",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5258,
      "src": "v_ancho := B_bp >= ancho_req ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_largo_req",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5304,
      "src": "largo_req := 2*(y_t + borde_placa_min) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_largo",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5350,
      "src": "v_largo := L_bp >= largo_req ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_recub",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5396,
      "src": "recub := exposicion == 1 ? 75 mm : (exposicion == 3 ? 40 mm : (d_perno > 16 mm ? 50 mm : 40 mm)) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_borde_horm",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5442,
      "src": "borde_horm_min := torque == 1 ? 6*d_perno : recub + d_perno/2 = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_bhB",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5488,
      "src": "borde_horm_B := PED_B/2 - x_ext = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_bhL",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5534,
      "src": "borde_horm_L := PED_L/2 - y_t = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_chorm",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5580,
      "src": "c_horm := min(borde_horm_B, borde_horm_L) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_borde_horm",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5626,
      "src": "v_borde_horm := c_horm >= borde_horm_min ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t028",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5672,
      "src": "━━ 8 — CORTE POR FRICCIÓN · DG1 Ec. 4-30 (ACI 318-25 §22.9 y ACI 349-13 D.6.1.4) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "t029",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5718,
      "src": "Solo si usa_friccion = 1. La resistencia es φ·μ·P con la compresión concurrente, sin pasar de 0,2·f'c·Ac ni de 800 psi·Ac, con φ = 0,75 en esos topes. Supuesto de la hoja: Ac es el área de la placa. En algunas aplicaciones sísmicas ASCE 7 (caps. 13 y 15) no permite la fricción, y la decisión es de quien diseña."
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Vfr",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5764,
      "src": "phiVn_fr := phi_fr*mu_fr*max(P_V, 0 kN) = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_Vtope",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5810,
      "src": "phiVn_tope := 0.75*min(0.2*fpc*A_1, 800 psi*A_1) = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_phiVn",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5856,
      "src": "phiVn := min(phiVn_fr, phiVn_tope) = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_u_fr",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5902,
      "src": "u_friccion := usa_friccion == 1 ? (phiVn > 0 kN ? V_u/phiVn : 99) : 0 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5948,
      "src": "━━ RESUMEN ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_umax",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5994,
      "src": "u_max := max(u_aplast, u_espesor, u_pernos, u_friccion) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r_gob",
      "kind": "program",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6040,
      "src": "gobierna :=\n    if u_max == u_aplast\n        return \"aplastamiento del hormigon\"\n    else if u_max == u_pernos\n        return \"area de los pernos en traccion\"\n    else if u_max == u_friccion\n        return \"corte por friccion\"\n    else if t_arr > t_aplast\n        return \"espesor de la chapa por el arranque\"\n    else\n        return \"espesor de la chapa por el aplastamiento\""
    },
    {
      "id": "v_global",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6310,
